{
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:0": "很順、很順！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:1": "照這樣下去，\n應該完全沒問題吧。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:2": "咦？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:3": "哇哇哇哇哇？\n糟糕了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:4": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:5": "呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:6": "要掉下去了──！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:7": "嗚啊啊啊啊啊啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:8": "咿──────！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/02 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:0": "還好剛好被我看到。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/02 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:12": "我在想，能不能想辦法\n把這個拿來當動力來源。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/02 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:13": "對了，到我的工作室來吧！\n我也有東西想給你看。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/02 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:15": "就在神祕遺跡那邊。\n從車站搭火車過去很快就到了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/02 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:2": "居然會讓飛機墜毀，\n這可不像你啊，塔爾斯。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/02 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:3": "我正在測試新型的飛機。\n好像是動力傳動系統出了問題。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/02 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:5": "說到飛機，你不是還有\n我寄放在你那裡的龍捲風號嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/02 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:6": "嘿嘿，這次我在構思\n更厲害的東西喔！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/03 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "哇～哈哈哈哈！\n是索尼克和塔爾斯啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/03 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "蛋頭博士！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/03 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:11": "否則的話……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/03 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "我是安分了好一陣子啦。\n不過接下來，又要開始忙起來了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/03 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "你又打算開始做什麼壞事了吧？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/04 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "什麼嘛，根本沒有嘴上說的那麼厲害。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/04 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:10": "這個卡歐斯每得到一顆混沌翡翠，\n就會變身得更加強大！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/04 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:11": "只要集齊全部７顆翡翠，\n牠就會成長為究極的怪物！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/04 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:17": "要是那隻怪物不斷變身下去，\n事情可就嚴重了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/04 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:18": "才不會讓蛋頭博士\n稱心如意呢！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/04 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:19": "只要不讓牠拿到翡翠，\n牠應該就沒辦法再變身了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/04 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:20": "索尼克！我們搶先一步\n把混沌翡翠收集起來吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/05 After Casinopolis (1)/Japanese.txt:1": "混沌翡翠被……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/05 After Casinopolis (1)/Japanese.txt:3": "呼哇！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/05 After Casinopolis (1)/Japanese.txt:5": "蛋頭……博士……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/06 After Casinopolis (2)/Japanese.txt:4": "我可不會輸給你喔，索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/07 Before Knuckles Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "你在做什麼！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/07 Before Knuckles Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "休想得逞！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/08 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:16": "卡歐斯……得想辦法對付牠才行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/08 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "這是怎麼回事？\n難道說……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/11 After Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:0": "……好像做了一個很懷念的夢啊……。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/11 After Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:1": "多虧了索尼克，\n我才能夠改變自己……。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/11 After Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:2": "……索尼克？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/11 After Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:3": "跟索尼克\n走散了啊……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/11 After Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:4": "可惡，果然原本的\n龍捲風號還是不行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/11 After Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:5": "想對抗蛋頭母艦……\n就得把那架新型機完成才行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/11 After Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:6": "為此……\n需要混沌翡翠。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/11 After Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:7": "得去找混沌翡翠才行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/12 Before Sand Hill/Japanese.txt:0": "找到了！\n是混沌翡翠！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/12 Before Sand Hill/Japanese.txt:1": "啊！喂！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/12 Before Sand Hill/Japanese.txt:2": "站住──────！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/13 After Sand Hill/Japanese.txt:0": "咦、咦？\n我剛才應該是在沙漠裡才對啊……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/13 After Sand Hill/Japanese.txt:1": "這是怎麼回事？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/14 You've found the Rhythm Badge/Japanese.txt:0": "是「節奏胸針」呢。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/14 You've found the Rhythm Badge/Japanese.txt:1": "只要一直按住動作鈕，\n應該就能使出連續尾巴攻擊喔。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:0": "「行使者。其為七個混沌」",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:1": "哎呀，你好。\n……你過得好嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:10": "可是「七個」這個詞\n讓我很在意。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:11": "跟那些翡翠的數量一樣……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:12": "翡翠……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:13": "我們是第一次見面吧。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:14": "你叫什麼名字呢？\n我叫蒂卡爾……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:2": "那個……剛才那是……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:3": "啊啊……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:4": "這是奶奶教我的話。\n聽說是很古老的傳說。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:5": "她說絕對不能忘記。\n……接下來是這樣的。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:6": "「行使者\n其為七個混沌」",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:7": "「混沌即力量\n力量因心而成其力量」",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:8": "「抑制者\n其為統御混沌之人」",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/15 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:9": "……雖然我不太明白\n這些話是什麼意思……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/16 Big and Froggy/Japanese.txt:0": "哇────咿！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/16 Big and Froggy/Japanese.txt:2": "等一下啦～。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/16 Big and Froggy/Japanese.txt:3": "怎、怎麼了啊～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/16 Big and Froggy/Japanese.txt:4": "啊，比起這個，\n混沌翡翠才是重點。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/16 Big and Froggy/Japanese.txt:5": "只要把這個帶回去……\n龍捲風２號就快完成了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/17 Before Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:0": "這一刻終於來了……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/17 Before Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:1": "強度已經比試作機提高了。\n理論上應該沒問題……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/17 Before Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:3": "它已經完成了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/17 Before Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:4": "接下來只要把這個……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/17 Before Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:5": "索尼克，我現在就過去……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/17 Before Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:6": "龍捲風２號，起飛！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/18 Red Mountain/Japanese.txt:0": "追上你了……蛋頭母艦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/18 Red Mountain/Japanese.txt:1": "找到索尼克了～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/23 Sky Deck Entrance/Japanese.txt:0": "前面就是『天空甲板』了吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/25 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "索尼克！塔爾斯！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/25 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:12": "剩下的就交給你了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/25 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:9": "把那些傢伙\n打成蜂窩！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/26 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "住手，塔爾斯！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/26 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "艾咪，很危險，快讓開！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/26 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:11": "我去追蛋頭博士！\n可不能放著那傢伙不管！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/26 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "不要！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/26 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "塔爾斯，拜託你，住手。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/26 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "嗯，我知道了……\n既然艾咪都這麼說了……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/26 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "一定是有什麼苦衷吧。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/26 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "這艘船的高度一直在往下掉！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/27 Eggman's Missile Attack/Japanese.txt:0": "蛋頭博士！？\n索尼克到底怎麼了……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/27 Eggman's Missile Attack/Japanese.txt:1": "卡歐斯被打倒，\n蛋頭母艦也沉了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/27 Eggman's Missile Attack/Japanese.txt:10": "不搶先阻止的話，\n蛋頭博士就要引爆飛彈了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/27 Eggman's Missile Attack/Japanese.txt:3": "既然如此，為了摧毀車站廣場，\n我可要不擇手段了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/27 Eggman's Missile Attack/Japanese.txt:4": "要是那種飛彈被發射出去……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/27 Eggman's Missile Attack/Japanese.txt:5": "好，發射！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/27 Eggman's Missile Attack/Japanese.txt:6": "咦咦！沒有爆炸！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/27 Eggman's Missile Attack/Japanese.txt:7": "可惡，這是怎麼回事！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/27 Eggman's Missile Attack/Japanese.txt:8": "混帳！我要親自\n去看看情況！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/27 Eggman's Missile Attack/Japanese.txt:9": "糟、糟糕了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/28 Before Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:0": "在那裡！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/28 Before Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:1": "得想辦法搶先一步\n把飛彈處理掉才行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/28 Before Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:2": "可是……要是我來不及的話，\n這座城市就會被炸飛了……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/28 Before Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:3": "索、索尼克……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/28 Before Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:4": "遇見索尼克之後，\n我才能夠改變自己……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/28 Before Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:5": "可是，我不能永遠只是\n跟在索尼克後面跑。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/28 Before Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:6": "總有一天，我必須靠自己的力量\n跑出去才行……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/29 Before Egg Walker Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "竟敢搶先一步處理掉飛彈，\n你幹得好事啊，塔爾斯！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/29 Before Egg Walker Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "我會讓你付出慘痛的代價！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/29 Before Egg Walker Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "哼，就憑你！\n我一下就把你捏爛！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/29 Before Egg Walker Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "不怕……我才不怕……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/29 Before Egg Walker Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "就算只有我一個人……也做得到！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/30 After Egg Walker Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "成功了……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/30 After Egg Walker Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "我一個人也做到了……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/31 Look, it's your Jet Anklet!/Japanese.txt:0": "是「噴射腳環」呢。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Tails/31 Look, it's your Jet Anklet!/Japanese.txt:1": "靠著噴射的力量，\n在空中飛行的速度會變快喔！"
}